b=section('catalogue','Complete building and upgrade reference')
p(b,'All 42 building types and 108 configured levels are included below. In each cost column the order is Scrap / Metal / Electronics. Level 1 is the new-building price; level 2 or 3 is the additional price of that upgrade, not a cumulative replacement price. Work means base work minutes. Staff is maximum operating staff; zero still requires builders during construction. HP is completed maximum building health.')
p(b,'Food, Water and conversion rates are per effective operating worker-hour for staffed producers and base building-hour for workerless producers. Hall rates require its Administrator. Capacity, slots and radii are not hourly stocks. Values are nominal healthy/full-staffed effects: condition, staffing, level, morale and storage can change actual results. Bonus percentages are reductions/increases of the relevant effect, not guaranteed percentage points of the final rate. The strongest shared support does not stack.')
