b=section('equipment','Complete hardware reference')
p(b,'These base unit work times are accelerated by effective factory staff, building condition and the factory\'s listed production bonus. Material cost is paid per unit when its work can start. The factory unlock comes from its building type; a storage home must also be unlocked and functional. No citizen XP or level system applies to hardware.')
table(b,['Hardware','Metal / Electronics','Work min','HP','Full strength','Physical loot'],[[u['name'],f"{u['metal']:g} / {u['electronics']:g}",f"{u['seconds']/60:g}",f"{u['hp']:g}" if u['hp'] else 'quantity',f"{u['strength']:g}" if k not in ('missile','interceptor','repair_drone') else 'see role',f"{u['loot']:g}" if u['loot'] else 'none'] for k,u in C['units'].items()],[130,105,68,60,80,75])
p(b,'Offensive Drone: strength 30 and 20 physical loot units. Air Defense Drone: strength 28. Ground Defense Drone: strength 25. Repair Drone: 10 HP/hour building repair at full health, no combat strength. Missile: 300-HP main structural hit plus splash, not a drone-combat strength. Interceptor: one interception attempt per incoming missile at the battery\'s configured success rate. Refer to the combat chapter for phase and target restrictions.')

